OL,3,GNEWSACouple deny embezzling #138,000
OL,4,Afrom dying boy's fundraiser
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scottish couple have appeared in
OL,7,Fcourt accused of embezzling #138,482
OL,8,Ffrom a fundraiser set up to help a
OL,9,Fdying boy.
OL,11,FProsecutors allege Sharyn and Mark
OL,12,FMcInally-Johnston embezzled the money
OL,13,Fwhile acting as organisers and
OL,14,Fadministrators of a GoFundMe set up for
OL,15,FNathaniel Nabena by his father.
OL,17,FNathaniel, from Nigeria, died from an
OL,18,Finfection in 2022, a year after
OL,19,Freceiving a stem-cell transplant.
